g - Filter public games to quickly find matches that fit your preferred settings and play style.\n- Handicap Requirements - Hosts can now set minimum and maximum handicap requirements when creating public games.\n- Updated Create & Join - Streamlined UI reduces friction and makes joining the right match seamless.\n\n### Upcoming Drops: \nClover Collection available starting 3/5!\n- Driver & Fairway Wood set\n- Iron & Wedges set\n- 1 Blade & Mallet Putter\n- 1 Golf Ball\n- 1 Golf Bag\n- 1 Club Shaft\n- 1 Club & Putter Grip\n- Complete set of Headcovers\n\n'80s Rad Collection coming 3/19!\n- Driver\n- Irons\n- 1 Blade & Mallet Putter\n- 1 Golf Bag\n- Complete set of Headcovers\n\n### Course Updates:\n- TPC Sawgrass: Hole 15 - A tree near the tee boxes had mismatched models.\n- Atolls: Hole 1 & 14 - Fixed some floating tree models near tee box and to the right of the green on an island.", "created_date": 1772671073, "id": "25893531480315587", "version": "805.02", "version_code": 15575, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 112}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25893531480315587"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1772136367, "id": "25836402579361811", "version": "805.01", "version_code": 15526, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 112}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "